    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist wakes up and finds himself trapped in a bird cage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn't remember why he is here, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >why he was locked in the birdcage, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or even who he is in the first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strangely enough, the key to unlock the birdcage has fallen at his feet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He opens the key and explores the terrifying and strange Western-style house, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >searching for himself and the way to escape from this Western-style house .....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time is About 30 minutes to 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live action, distribution, and derivative works are welcome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the content is based on true stories experienced by the author.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the normal ending, there are 6 BADEND</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Controls\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space, Enter Z button: Decide, fast forward  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > X button: Open menu screen, cancel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASDW key: Move character </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift key: Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When installing the game, you will be given a choice of startup options. For the Japanese version, please select [Play before you get trapped by the black lily], and for the English version, please select [English ver].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only difference between the two is the initial display language, which can be changed after installation by going to [Settings] &gt; [Language].</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist wakes up and finds himself trapped in a bird cage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn't remember why he is here, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >why he was locked in the birdcage, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or even who he is in the first place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strangely enough, the key to unlock the birdcage has fallen at his feet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He opens the key and explores the terrifying and strange Western-style house, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >searching for himself and the way to escape from this Western-style house .....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time is About 30 minutes to 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live action, distribution, and derivative works are welcome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the content is based on true stories experienced by the author.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the normal ending, there are 6 BADEND</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Controls\u3011 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space, Enter Z button: Decide, fast forward  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > X button: Open menu screen, cancel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASDW key: Move character </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift key: Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When installing the game, you will be given a choice of startup options. For the Japanese version, please select [Play before you get trapped by the black lily], and for the English version, please select [English ver].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only difference between the two is the initial display language, which can be changed after installation by going to [Settings] &gt; [Language].</p>",
    "short_description": "A horror adventure game in which you control the main character, a young girl with amnesia, as she explores a strange and terrifying Western-style house. Help the girl regain her memory and escape from the Western-style house by solving riddles and disarming tricks that obstruct your escape.",
